[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":312},["ShallowReactive",2],{"6GV8s9KYVOARm_5cmnurg7PXS0SRC94JHfaPyhvHpsI":3},{"seo":4,"slug":8,"isDarkTheme":9,"heroBackgroundColour":10,"highlightColour":12,"simpleTitle":5,"excerpt":14,"hero":15,"heroAsset":29,"location":44,"sector":45,"services":52,"introCopy":53,"storyblockAccordions":54,"storyblockAssets":64,"flexibleContent":96,"footerLinkLabel":304,"footerLinks":305},{"title":5,"description":6,"image":7},"Ulu Cliffhouse","ULU sits atop Uluwatu Cliffs, offering epic surf, sunsets, and luxury. A world-class private members' club in Bali’s most breathtaking location.",null,"ulu-cliffhouse",false,{"hex":11},"#3A87A5",{"hex":13},"#FFFCAE","Building a world class destination from the rock-face up.",{"title":16,"subtitle":17},"\u003Cp>ULU\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>CLIFFHOUSE\u003C/p>",{"value":18,"links":28},{"schema":19,"document":20},"dast",{"type":21,"children":22},"root",[23],{"type":24,"children":25},"paragraph",[26],{"type":27,"value":14},"span",[],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":33},900,"",1600,{"width":34,"height":35,"url":36,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":37},1583,997,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1726583171-2017-09-07-photo-00000256.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":38,"srcSet":39,"src":40,"width":41,"height":42,"sizes":43},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1726583171-2017-09-07-photo-00000256.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1726583171-2017-09-07-photo-00000256.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1726583171-2017-09-07-photo-00000256.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1726583171-2017-09-07-photo-00000256.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1726583171-2017-09-07-photo-00000256.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200",3200,2015,"(max-width: 3200px) 100vw, 3200px","Padang-Padang, Bali, Indonesia",[46,49],{"slug":47,"label":48},"hospitality","Hospitality",{"slug":50,"label":51},"health-leisure","Health & Leisure","Architecture, Landscape, Interior Design. ","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiNkNjcFhIbkw1SVl6bzNyemkxekVEdyIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjI5NzExODc4NSwiZGF0YVR5cGUiOiJzY2VuZSJ9Cg==(/figmeta)--&gt;\" style=\"caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>On top of the dramatic Uluwatu Cliffs sits our most stunning project location. Boasting some of the world&rsquo;s best surf and killer views to match, sunsets and breakers roll in from the Western horizon. The stage to create one of the best member&rsquo;s clubs in the world.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[55,58,61],{"title":56,"copy":57},"The Challenge","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Convert a disused and derelict recording studio into a world class beach resort. An all encompassing brief from architecture, pool and landscaping, to the club&rsquo;s suite of hospitality and boutique villa offers.\u2028\u2028\u2028\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>\u003Cbr />\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":59,"copy":60},"The Strategy","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiNkNjcFhIbkw1SVl6bzNyemkxekVEdyIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE5NDQ0NTgyODYsImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)--&gt;\" style=\"caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>We knew it was about getting the right recipe to stand out in the Balinese resort scene. Creating rich and varied layers within a single destination.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>Part beach: Laid-back vibes with a distinct nod to Uluwatu&rsquo;s rich surf heritage.\u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>Part natural: Celebrating Bali&rsquo;s world-famous natural materials, foliage and craftsmanship.\u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>Part jet set: All the panache of an international member&rsquo;s club.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":62,"copy":63},"The Solution","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiNkNjcFhIbkw1SVl6bzNyemkxekVEdyIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE1NzQ3MDc4ODksImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)--&gt;\" style=\"caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>The result was an attitude both boutique and punchy, inspired by a new generation of one-off venues that dance to the beat of their own drum. \u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>Described by Tatler Magazine as one of the best private clubs in the world, Ulu has quickly become a firm favourite on the international club circuit. When superstar DJ Carl Cox turns up to host his own party, you know you&rsquo;ve done something right.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Credits: Video content by Ulu Cliffhouse.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[65,75,85],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":66},{"width":67,"height":68,"url":69,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":70},2094,1178,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1718284418-ulu-storyblock-1.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":71,"srcSet":72,"src":73,"width":67,"height":68,"sizes":74},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1718284418-ulu-storyblock-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1718284418-ulu-storyblock-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1047w,https://www.dat